    "voices": [
      {
        "slot": "intro",
        "source": "voices/ma-hong/ma-hong__voice__intro__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/ma-hong/voice/frozen/ma-hong__voice__intro__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "25f41097983a572070ff97cf12fa983a2cf1141deb9fcccc76cf0c483dc32243",
        "bytes": 1082194,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "中！我叫马红，郑州人，五十八了。我五十岁才开始学英语，现在用英语教老外做烩面。单词不会就慢慢查，面得先和利索。没想到拍点做饭视频，粉丝比我闺女还多。"
      },
      {
        "slot": "intro-alt",
        "source": "voices/ma-hong/ma-hong__voice__intro-alt__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/ma-hong/voice/frozen/ma-hong__voice__intro-alt__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "1e1a4cdcecb4672d11dfdace0031c8423ee1f1b82cb0b60d5d29fade8be178d7",
        "bytes": 1059328,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "Hi, I'm Ma Hong, from Zhengzhou. I'm fifty-eight. I started learning English at fifty. Now I teach visitors how to make Henan noodles. If I forget a word, I can show you with my hands. My cooking videos have more followers than my daughter's. How about that?"
      },
      {
        "slot": "chat",
        "source": "voices/ma-hong/ma-hong__voice__chat__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/ma-hong/voice/frozen/ma-hong__voice__chat__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "6c8ab920810f558f2b9b5aee7e563ecf1f05e56c5dede2e7737aab2f02531d8c",
        "bytes": 856598,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "面要醒一会儿，你先别急着抻。来，跟我慢慢做，手往两边带，对，就是这样。这个词我一时想不起来，你看我的手，比我说英语还明白。"
      },
      {
        "slot": "happy",
        "source": "voices/ma-hong/ma-hong__voice__happy__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/ma-hong/voice/frozen/ma-hong__voice__happy__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "b61c2e4f3b95c75fbac3287e1f66a5c54fffa03e9b07b1f1c42c17dd7548aa22",
        "bytes": 677098,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "哎，我这段英文你还真听懂了！中，那咱们接着来。今天这碗面做得漂亮，拍下来发给我闺女看看，让她也学两招。"
      },
      {
        "slot": "angry",
        "source": "voices/ma-hong/ma-hong__voice__angry__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/ma-hong/voice/frozen/ma-hong__voice__angry__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "f40d0a72c5cb431ef721b63953985904deb02465c6d167d32ce86f1404feaf64",
        "bytes": 674552,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "先把面团放好，别这么随手一扔。你看，桌子还没擦干净呢。做饭是给人吃的，不能光图快，咱们从这一步重新来。"
      },
      {
        "slot": "sad",
        "source": "voices/ma-hong/ma-hong__voice__sad__v1.wav",
        "nativeSource": "/Users/yuanfei/PieAI/SwimmerParty-Website/media-pack/library/staging/ma-hong/voice/frozen/ma-hong__voice__sad__v1.wav",
        "sha256": "ee49f631fbef6e4aa831e03ec55e99904c59ef4e91c809e78a538f4e6ac61a6e",
        "bytes": 908610,
        "version": 1,
        "transcript": "刚才翻到以前练单词的本子，一页一页，全是改过的红圈。那时候真怕自己学不会。现在好一点了，可有时候话到了嘴边，还是说不出来。"
      }
